*> Test helper of the Nether tests (COPY it after the test program; the program COPYs CBLOCKS): NETHER-TABLES fills the block table with
*> the blocks the generator places (states: air 0, netherrack 100, lava 102, bedrock 7, basalt 101, gravel 103, blackstone 104, soul_sand 105,
*> soul_soil 106, warped_wart_block 107, warped_nylium 108, nether_wart_block 109, crimson_nylium 110) and the biome table with the five Nether
*> biomes in the order nether_wastes 0, soul_sand_valley 1, crimson_forest 2, warped_forest 3, basalt_deltas 4. Test infrastructure.
 NETHER-TABLES.
     MOVE 12 TO CB-BLOCK-COUNT
     MOVE "minecraft:netherrack" TO CB-KEY(1)
     MOVE 20 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(1)
     MOVE 100 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(1)
     MOVE "minecraft:lava" TO CB-KEY(2)
     MOVE 14 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(2)
     MOVE 102 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(2)
     MOVE "minecraft:bedrock" TO CB-KEY(3)
     MOVE 17 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(3)
     MOVE 7 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(3)
     MOVE "minecraft:basalt" TO CB-KEY(4)
     MOVE 16 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(4)
     MOVE 101 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(4)
     MOVE "minecraft:gravel" TO CB-KEY(5)
     MOVE 16 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(5)
     MOVE 103 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(5)
     MOVE "minecraft:blackstone" TO CB-KEY(6)
     MOVE 20 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(6)
     MOVE 104 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(6)
     MOVE "minecraft:soul_sand" TO CB-KEY(7)
     MOVE 19 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(7)
     MOVE 105 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(7)
     MOVE "minecraft:soul_soil" TO CB-KEY(8)
     MOVE 19 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(8)
     MOVE 106 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(8)
     MOVE "minecraft:warped_wart_block" TO CB-KEY(9)
     MOVE 27 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(9)
     MOVE 107 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(9)
     MOVE "minecraft:warped_nylium" TO CB-KEY(10)
     MOVE 23 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(10)
     MOVE 108 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(10)
     MOVE "minecraft:nether_wart_block" TO CB-KEY(11)
     MOVE 27 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(11)
     MOVE 109 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(11)
     MOVE "minecraft:crimson_nylium" TO CB-KEY(12)
     MOVE 24 TO CB-KEY-LENGTH(12)
     MOVE 110 TO CB-DEFAULT-STATE(12)
     MOVE 5 TO CBI-COUNT
     MOVE "minecraft:nether_wastes" TO CBI-KEY(1)
     MOVE 23 TO CBI-KEY-LENGTH(1)
     MOVE "minecraft:soul_sand_valley" TO CBI-KEY(2)
     MOVE 26 TO CBI-KEY-LENGTH(2)
     MOVE "minecraft:crimson_forest" TO CBI-KEY(3)
     MOVE 24 TO CBI-KEY-LENGTH(3)
     MOVE "minecraft:warped_forest" TO CBI-KEY(4)
     MOVE 23 TO CBI-KEY-LENGTH(4)
     MOVE "minecraft:basalt_deltas" TO CBI-KEY(5)
     MOVE 23 TO CBI-KEY-LENGTH(5)
     CALL "NETHER-STATES".
